WEBVTT

00:00:31.320 --> 00:00:32.720
(GASPS)

00:01:08.760 --> 00:01:10.120
(RUSTLING)

00:01:14.280 --> 00:01:15.760
(HOOFBEATS)

00:01:25.600 --> 00:01:27.720
(BOTH SCREAMING)

00:02:08.280 --> 00:02:09.840
(STAMMERING)

00:02:18.840 --> 00:02:21.000
Were you hiding from me?
你是在躲着我吗？

00:02:25.680 --> 00:02:26.800
No.
不是的

00:02:27.680 --> 00:02:28.920
Well...
呃…

00:02:30.600 --> 00:02:32.160
I just... I...
我只是…我…

00:02:32.680 --> 00:02:34.680
No. No. I just...
不 我只是…

00:02:34.840 --> 00:02:37.680
I was just... I didn't want to scare you.
我只是…我不想吓着你

00:02:38.200 --> 00:02:39.200
(CHUCKLES)

00:02:40.200 --> 00:02:44.680
If you don't mind my asking...
What are you?
请别介意我这么问
你是什么？

00:02:45.120 --> 00:02:47.600
Well, I'm a... Well, I'm a faun.
呃 我是…我是人羊

00:02:48.400 --> 00:02:49.800
And what about you?
你呢？

00:02:49.960 --> 00:02:53.040
You must be some kind of
beardless dwarf?
你肯定是没有长毛的侏儒吧？

00:02:53.200 --> 00:02:56.160
I'm not a dwarf! I'm a girl!
我才不是侏儒 我是个女孩

00:02:58.120 --> 00:03:01.720
And, actually, I'm tallest in my class.
而且我是我们班最高的

00:03:06.720 --> 00:03:09.320
You mean to say that
you're a Daughter of Eve?
你是说你是夏娃的女儿？

00:03:09.480 --> 00:03:11.280
Well, my mum's name is Helen.
我妈妈的名字叫海伦

00:03:11.440 --> 00:03:15.480
Yes, but you are in fact human.
对 可你确实是个人类

00:03:16.680 --> 00:03:18.400
Yes, of course.
对 当然了

00:03:21.120 --> 00:03:22.720
What are you doing here?
你来这儿干什么？

00:03:22.920 --> 00:03:26.320
Well, I was hiding in the wardrobe
in the spare room, and...
我正躲在空房间的衣橱里
结果…

00:03:26.480 --> 00:03:28.600
Spare Oom? Is that in Narnia?
空皇疆？
这地方属于纳尼亚吗？

00:03:28.800 --> 00:03:31.240
Narnia? What's that?
纳尼亚？那是什么？

00:03:32.280 --> 00:03:34.800
(CHUCKLING) Well,
dear girl, you're in it.
孩子 这儿就是纳尼亚的国土

00:03:34.960 --> 00:03:37.160
Everything from the lamppost,
从那个灯柱一直到

00:03:37.320 --> 00:03:40.880
all the way to Castle Cair Paravel
on the Eastern Ocean,
东海边上的凯尔帕拉瓦大城堡

00:03:41.520 --> 00:03:46.800
every stick and stone you see,
every icicle is Narnia.
每个冰柱 都属于纳尼亚

00:03:48.840 --> 00:03:51.280
This is an awfully big wardrobe.
这个衣橱真是大得惊人啊

00:03:52.440 --> 00:03:55.160
War Drobe? I'm sorry.
衣橱？对不起

00:03:55.320 --> 00:03:58.960
Please allow me to introduce myself.
My name is Tumnus.
请容许我做一下自我介绍
我的名字叫吐纳思

00:03:59.160 --> 00:04:02.600
Pleased to meet you, Mr Tumnus.
I'm Lucy Pevensie.
很高兴认识你 吐纳思先生
我叫露西派文西

00:04:06.880 --> 00:04:10.360
-Oh, you shake it.
-(STAMMERING) Why?
哦 你应该握握我的手
为什么？

00:04:12.080 --> 00:04:14.440
I... I don't know.
我…我也不知道

00:04:15.160 --> 00:04:17.880
People do it
when they meet each other.
人们见面的时候都会这么做

00:04:24.040 --> 00:04:26.160
(LAUGHING)
好吧 来自奇妙的空皇疆王国

00:04:26.320 --> 00:04:31.080
Well, then, Lucy Pevensie
from the shining city of War Drobe
好吧 来自奇妙的空皇疆王国

00:04:31.280 --> 00:04:34.320
in the wondrous land of Spare Oom,
…那光明的衣橱之城的
露西派文西

00:04:34.480 --> 00:04:37.800
how would it be if you came
and had tea with me?
你愿意跟我一起喝杯茶吗？

00:04:38.960 --> 00:04:41.520
Well, thank you very much, but I...
谢谢你 可是我…

00:04:43.160 --> 00:04:45.160
I probably should be getting back.
我该回去了

00:04:45.320 --> 00:04:49.240
It's only just around the corner.
And there'll be a glorious fire
只要转个弯就到了
里面生着很旺的炉火

00:04:49.400 --> 00:04:53.680
with toast and tea and cakes.
还有面包 茶水和蛋糕

00:04:53.840 --> 00:04:57.000
And, perhaps, we'll even
break into the sardines.
甚至还能吃点沙丁鱼

00:04:58.320 --> 00:05:00.840
-I don't know.
-Come on.
我真的不知道
来吧

00:05:01.800 --> 00:05:05.120
It's not every day
that I get to make a new friend.
我并不是每天都能交到新朋友

00:05:05.280 --> 00:05:08.680
Well, I suppose I could come
for a little while.
我想我可以坐上一小会儿

00:05:09.720 --> 00:05:11.960
If you have sardines.
如果你有沙丁鱼的话

00:05:12.840 --> 00:05:14.600
By the bucketload.
有一大桶呢

00:05:26.400 --> 00:05:28.000
You all right?
你还好吧？

00:05:36.560 --> 00:05:38.560
Well, here we are.
我们到了

00:05:38.760 --> 00:05:40.200
Come along.
进来吧

00:05:46.400 --> 00:05:48.680
-TUMNUS: After you.
-May I help you with that?
你先请
我来帮你拿吧

00:05:48.840 --> 00:05:50.040
Thank you very much.
谢谢你

00:05:50.200 --> 00:05:51.480
(EXCLAIMS)
谢谢你

